+Story #662 under Feature #653 (feature plan item 9): run /intent, /vision and /understand by hand on a test project with Garura installed, from memory alone — every answer names its memory (a decision trace, ADR 037), a gap raises a memory update a person approves (ADR 035, ADR 036), and nothing comes from the model alone. The run is recorded in the issue's folder: each answer with its source, and at least one memory update raised, approved and used; no answer lacks a source. Passing it passes the Kickoff milestone so #613 can pick up again. Larger findings become their own issues. Needs #661 (merged, PR #678). Rules in force: ADR 039 (every memory write goes to short-term memory; a play reads no memory; the issue ID governs) and ADR 040.
